  <div id="sutta">
  
    <h4 id="thag1.56" class="h1">Thag 1:56  Kuṭivihārin (1)</h4>
            <div class="verse">
              <p>Who’s in the hut?</p>
              <p>A monk’s in the hut—</p>
              <p class="v2">free from passion,</p>
              <p class="v2">with well-centered mind.</p>
              <p>Know this, my friend:</p>
              <p class="v2">The hut you built</p>
              <p class="v2">wasn’t wasted.</p>
            </div><!--end verse-->
      </div><!--end:sutta-->
    </div><!--end:content-->
    
